stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Menu
    Menu --> Running: Start or R / reset run
    Running --> Paused: Escape or focus loss / clear input
    Paused --> Running: Resume / rebase wall clock
    Paused --> Running: Retry or R / reset run
    Running --> Running: R / reset run
    Running --> Failed: Terrain, bounds, timeout, or zero hull
    Running --> Won: Ring ten and alive with time remaining
    Won --> Running: Retry or R / reset run
    Failed --> Running: Retry or R / reset run
    note right of Running
        One controller commits transitions.
        Failure precedes a same-update win.
    end note
    note right of Paused
        Active time and simulation time freeze.
        Regaining focus does not resume.
    end note
